Description: Unofficial configurator for the Endgame Gear KB65HE 8k keyboard
 Configure actuation point, rapid trigger, lighting and profiles of the
 Endgame Gear KB65HE 8k hall-effect keyboard on Linux. Talks to the keyboard
 directly over hidraw; includes a Qt GUI (kb65he-gui) and a CLI (kb65he).
 .
 Not affiliated with Endgame Gear.
